    "text_full": "By JOHN GRUBER\n\nARCHIVE\nTHE TALK SHOW\nDITHERING\nPROJECTS\nCONTACT\nCOLOPHON\nFEEDS / SOCIAL\nSPONSORSHIP\n\nWorkOS — Agents need context. Ship the integrations that give it to them.\n\nSyndicated Feeds\nMASTODON AND TWITTER\n\nYou should definitely follow Daring Fireball on Mastodon and Twitter, and perhaps follow John Gruber too.\n\nSUBSCRIBE TO THE MAIN FEED\n\nThe main feed for everything on Daring Fireball:\n\nRSS: https://daringfireball.net/feeds/main\nJSON: https://daringfireball.net/feeds/json\nTHE TALK SHOW\n\nSubscribe to Daring Fireball’s podcast, The Talk Show:\n\nhttps://daringfireball.net/thetalkshow/rss\n\nARTICLES-ONLY FEED\n\nA feed containing only the longer, feature articles (like the “old” DF feed) is available as a less-frequently-updated alternative:\n\nhttps://daringfireball.net/feeds/articles\n\nSPONSORSHIP\n\nInformation and rates for week-long exclusive sponsorship of the Daring Fireball feed.\n\n \n\nDisplay Preferences\n\nCopyright © 2002–2026 The Daring Fireball Company LLC."
